# NOTE: this repo *is* the published website — every committed file is served
# at www.malmgren.dev. Only list things that must not be published or must not
# be tracked. Do not add site content here.

# Claude Code machine-local settings.
# A shared .claude/settings.json is fine to commit; this one is per-machine.
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.md

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# Node. Nothing here installs into the repo — CI runs html-validate through
# npx — but this catches a stray local `npm install`.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Secrets. There should never be any in a static site, but a committed .env is
# unrecoverable once pushed to a public repo.
.env
.env.*
